    "result_text": "Both e2e tests pass and the frontend typechecks cleanly.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented client contacts (name, email, role) as a small, additive full-stack change, following the project's conventions where contacts mirror the existing \"projects\" client sub-resource pattern.\n\n**Database** (`src/main/resources/db/migration/V8__contacts.sql`)\n- New `contacts` table: `id, name, email, role, client_id` (FK \u2192 clients), `GENERATED BY DEFAULT` so the seed path can supply explicit fixture ids.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST + Spring)\n- `Contact` entity, `ContactRepository` (`findByClientIdOrderByIdAsc`), `NewContact` request body.\n- `ClientContactsGet` + `clients/{clientId}/contacts.GET.yml` \u2192 lists a client's contacts.\n- `ContactsPost` + `contacts.POST.yml` \u2192 creates a contact, validating name/role present, email well-formed (mirroring `ClientsPost`), and client exists; returns the saved row.\n- Extended `TestSupportController` to `TRUNCATE contacts` on reset and to seed a `contacts` fixture array by explicit id.\n\n**Front-end** (all new files, plus one line to introduce a slot region)\n- `slots/defs/clientDetail.ts` \u2014 new `ClientDetail` slot region; rendered on the client detail route via a single `<ClientDetail.Slot clientId={id} />` line (rule 3: adding the region).\n- `features/contacts/` \u2014 `queries.ts` (query under `['clients', clientId, 'contacts']`, mutation invalidates the same key), `ClientContactsTable.tsx`, `ContactForm.tsx`, and `contacts.slot.tsx` filling the region.\n\n**data-testid anchors matched to the spec:** `client-contacts-table`, `contact-row-<id>`, `contact-name`, `contact-role` (plus `contact-email`), and `contact-form-name` / `-email` / `-role` / `-submit`.\n\nVerification: `bin/e2e` \u2192 2 passed; `npm run typecheck` clean. I did not touch any pinned scaffolding or the test spec.",
